    "summary": "For an **IMPERIAL KNIGHTS** model. As your opponent's turn ends, once per battle for your army, you may use this if the bearer's unit is **unengaged**. If you do, that unit:\n\n- is placed in **Strategic Reserves**\n- has **[Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)** until your next Shooting phase starts\n- is required to arrive by **ingress move** during your following Movement phase, even in your first turn",
